{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Hey Joanna! Long time no see! What's up? Anything fun going on?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-42/session_1-b0310beb627f82fab5fd0de5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:36:35.833685+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b0310beb627f82fab5fd0de5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b0310beb627f82fab5fd0de5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Hey Nate! Long time no see! I've been working on a project lately - it's been pretty cool. What about you - any fun projects or hobbies?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-42/session_1-dccf91d848d56d3e5c3c1292", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:36:35.862251+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dccf91d848d56d3e5c3c1292", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dccf91d848d56d3e5c3c1292", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Hey Joanna! That's cool! I won my first video game tournament last week - so exciting!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-42/session_1-9b50c7c15aa253e7816dffa2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:36:35.879705+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9b50c7c15aa253e7816dffa2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9b50c7c15aa253e7816dffa2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Wow Nate! Congrats on winning! Tell me more - what game was it?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-42/session_1-a55b77ffbc7a616de089e905", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:36:35.896055+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a55b77ffbc7a616de089e905", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a55b77ffbc7a616de089e905", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Thanks! it's a team shooter game."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-42/session_1-911fde0c11a1dc427df7dde3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:36:35.912821+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "911fde0c11a1dc427df7dde3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "911fde0c11a1dc427df7dde3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Wow, great job! What was is called?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-42/session_1-0d5675a53b478a32ac73e7d2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:36:35.929064+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0d5675a53b478a32ac73e7d2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0d5675a53b478a32ac73e7d2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: The game was called Counter-Strike: Global Offensive, and me and my team had a blast to the very end!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-42/session_1-7c565291209449dcb983e0cb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:36:35.942833+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7c565291209449dcb983e0cb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7c565291209449dcb983e0cb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Cool, Nate! Sounds like a fun experience, even if I'm not into games."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-42/session_1-f5f00dabdaa9551f97573b49", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:36:35.959913+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f5f00dabdaa9551f97573b49", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f5f00dabdaa9551f97573b49", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: It was! How about you? Do you have any hobbies you love?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-42/session_1-2f66edf07418ca68ef7b5790", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:36:35.974951+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2f66edf07418ca68ef7b5790", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2f66edf07418ca68ef7b5790", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Yeah! Besides writing, I also enjoy reading, watching movies, and exploring nature. Anything else you enjoy doing, Nate?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-42/session_1-66b1fb949623301dac6fb902", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:36:35.991238+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "66b1fb949623301dac6fb902", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "66b1fb949623301dac6fb902", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Playing video games and watching movies are my main hobbies."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-42/session_1-b458424f4e4871512f9bf3fc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:36:36.010079+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b458424f4e4871512f9bf3fc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b458424f4e4871512f9bf3fc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Cool, Nate! So we both have similar interests. What type of movies do you like best?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-42/session_1-f764740859c49456e39e445c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:36:36.024139+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f764740859c49456e39e445c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f764740859c49456e39e445c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: I love action and sci-fi movies, the effects are so cool! What about you, what's your favorite genre?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-42/session_1-6196a6491c41e1aacb53e648", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:36:36.039180+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6196a6491c41e1aacb53e648", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6196a6491c41e1aacb53e648", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: I'm all about dramas and romcoms. I love getting immersed in the feelings and plots."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-42/session_1-dd7d7e9134131019310bd97c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:36:36.057064+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dd7d7e9134131019310bd97c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dd7d7e9134131019310bd97c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Wow, movies can be so powerful! Do you have any recommendations for me?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-42/session_1-1e4d73bcb08ba1325df5d730", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:36:36.077060+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1e4d73bcb08ba1325df5d730", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1e4d73bcb08ba1325df5d730", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Yeah, totally! Have you seen this romantic drama that's all about memory and relationships? It's such a good one."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-42/session_1-46527cac82f8213f6bcadb26", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:36:36.092825+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "46527cac82f8213f6bcadb26", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "46527cac82f8213f6bcadb26", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
